Short:    Super-AmiLog v2.00 - Last Callers/Stats
Uploader: Leo Davidson <leo.davidson@keble.oxford.ac.uk>
Author:   Leo Davidson <leo.davidson@keble.oxford.ac.uk>
Type:     comm/amiex

SAmiLog.lha - Super-AmiLog v2.00 by P0T-NOoDLE. (Assembler)

- Last callers / system stats util.
* Keeps records of best number of callers etc in one day.
* Outputs a list of weekly statistics and averages.
* Multinode compatable.
* Configurable number of users shown.
* Random messages and header/footer texts.
* Can be made Resident.
* Mini-Callerslog made with compact info about each call.
* For each user, can show Baud,Node,Name,Location,Connect Time,Logoff Time,
  Time Spent Online, Up/Down KBytes,Actions.
* Actions include: Up/Download, Up/Download Failed, Password Hack,
  Lost Carrier, Paged Sysop, Sysop Cmds.
* Shows info about today's, yesterday's, and the best stats for number of
  callers, uploads, time used, etc in compact form.
- SAmiLog v3.00 was never finished, sorry! It would have handled TopCPS,
  user definable (and randomly chosen) outputs, and lot of other things.
  The source code was released to Aminet for anyone who wants to finish it.

*** This archive is *not* *new*, I am just putting all the Gods'Gift utils
*** on Aminet for everyone (and so that people can stop bothering me :-).

